  "brief": "<h2><span class=\"sec-icon\">◆</span> Market Overview</h2>\nPre-market is showing risk-on rotation with small caps (IWM +1.52%) and NASDAQ (+1.23%) leading the charge. VIX elevated at 26.78 signals underlying tension, but bulls are buying the geopolitical dip. Industrials and materials outperforming suggests infrastructure/defense play is in motion.\n\n<h2><span class=\"sec-icon\">◆</span> What to Watch</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Iran tensions escalating</strong> - Trump's aggressive rhetoric on Kharg Island could spike oil volatility</li>\n<li><strong>SpaceX IPO chatter</strong> - Market digesting potential impact on growth rotation</li>\n<li><strong>Light earnings slate</strong> - Focus shifts to price action and sector momentum</li>\n<li><strong>Economic calendar empty</strong> - Pure technicals and news-driven trading today</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2><span class=\"sec-icon\">◆</span> Sector Rotation</h2>\nClear flight to cyclicals with industrials (+1.68%) and materials (+1.49%) leading on defense/infrastructure themes. Tech holding strong (+1.30%) despite geopolitical noise. Defensives like REITs and comm services lagging suggests risk appetite intact despite elevated VIX.\n\n<div class=\"callout callout-green\"><div class=\"callout-label\">✦ Bull Case</div>Small cap outperformance (IWM +1.52%) signals domestic focus amid foreign tensions. Industrial complex pricing in infrastructure spending boom.</div>\n\n<div class=\"callout callout-amber\"><div class=\"callout-label\">⚡ Key Driver</div>Iran situation could trigger energy sector breakout - XLE only up 0.36% but massive upside if tensions escalate further.</div>\n\n<div class=\"callout callout-red\"><div class=\"callout-label\">⚠ Bear Case</div>VIX at 26.78 with markets rallying is classic divergence. One bad headline could trigger swift reversal in risk assets.</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"sec-icon\">◆</span> Levels That Matter</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SPY $730</strong> - Clean breakout level, pre-market testing now</li>\n<li><strong>QQQ $705</strong> - Key resistance from May highs</li>\n<li><strong>VIX $25</strong> - Support break would signal fear subsiding</li>\n<li><strong>XLE $95</strong> - Energy sector poised for breakout on Iran news</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n<p><em>Not a prediction. A preparation. Make your plan before the bell.</em></p>",
